    ...         cell_dn=/MRBTS-1/RAT-1/RUNTIME_VIEW-${rtId}/MRBTS_R-${rtId}/NRBTS_R-${tCellId}/NRCELL_R-${tCellId}

Stop 5g uplink Test     #u
